--- OnlyVolunteers modification notice (2026-10-11, G14 v02) ---
Derived from MatrixRex/Uber-Stylized-Water commit 1fdd16c6312611fef7fb248dee86cdd3fd456a1e.
Copyright (c) 2026 OnlyVolunteers contributors. Modifications are distributed under the same MIT terms above.
Changes: a forward-only composition retaining the upstream Gerstner and two-way-normal graph functions;
two half2 UV temporaries promoted to float2; metre-based three-stop depth colour, layered foam and crest caps;
bounded UV1 river flow, glints/fresnel, guarded refraction, procedural caustics, waterfall and splash modes.
The parent original shader, LICENSE and v01 materials remain unchanged. This notice adds no licence restrictions.
G14c colour revision: muted sea/lake/river palette, warm off-white foam, sparse smaller glints and blue-grey fresnel.
